      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Paired conjugate values are powerful.\n\nIf x=4+√15 and y=4−√15, then x+y=8 and xy=1.\n\nSo x²+y²=(x+y)²−2xy=64−2=62.\n\nThe surds cancel in the sum and product.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_5"
